  "description": "All I wanted to do was save my sister’s game, but how did I get dragged into it? I got transmigrated into my younger sister’s stupid dating simulation game!\n\nJin-Su Lee has played this game before and knows enough about it… to realize he’s been transmigrated as a trouble-making, good-for-nothing villain who dies way too soon. His new plan is to lead a quiet life while he figures out a way back to his world. But somehow, this isn’t going the way he planned. Can Jin-Su find his way back from his sister’s dating simulation game?\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS, edited)\n\n*Notes:\n\\- Includes seven side story chapters rated R19.\n\\- This was first published in English on POCKET COMICS (2023-01-24), but its first AniList-eligible publication was in Japanese by comico (2023-06-18), and its Korean release was not until 2023-11-10 on KakaoPage and Kakao Webtoon.*",
